# Business Logic – Change Lite

## Risk Calculation
- Script Include evaluates:
  - Impact
  - Urgency
  - Category
- Produces numeric risk score and risk level

## Approval Logic
- Normal changes with Moderate or High risk
  require CAB approval
- Approval handled using Flow Designer
- Rejected changes automatically closed

## Emergency Changes
- Auto-approved
- Mandatory justification enforced via UI Policy
- Server-side validation ensures safety

## Blackout Enforcement
- GlideSchedule used to validate blackout window
- Non-emergency changes blocked during blackout
- Emergency changes bypass blackout

## Incident to Change
- UI Action on Incident form
- Copies relevant fields into Change
- Provides traceability and faster remediation
